V12 _net20 0 DC 5
V13 0 _net21 DC 5
C6 _net19 _net22  10N 
R11 _net19 _net22  1.59K tc1=0.0 tc2=0.0 
R12 _net17 _net19  1.59K tc1=0.0 tc2=0.0 
XOP7 0 0 _net23 _net24 _net25 _net26 SpiceOpamp_LM324
V14 _net24 0 DC 5
V15 0 _net25 DC 5
R13 _net27 _net23  15.9K tc1=0.0 tc2=0.0 
C7 _net22 _net27  100N 
R14 _net23 _net26  15.9K tc1=0.0 tc2=0.0 
XOP8 0 0 _net28 _net29 _net30 VOUT_FILTER_TRAN SpiceOpamp_LM324
V16 _net29 0 DC 5
V17 0 _net30 DC 5
