V18 VIN_TRAN _net31 DC 0 SIN(0 0.2 10K 0 0 0) AC 0.2 ACPHASE 0
V19 _net31 _net32 DC 0 SIN(0 0.2 1K 0 0 0) AC 0.2 ACPHASE 0
