XOP11 0 0 _net44 _net45 _net46 _net47 SpiceOpamp_LM324
V28 _net45 0 DC 5
V29 0 _net46 DC 5
R21 _net48 _net44  15.9K tc1=0.0 tc2=0.0 
C11 _net43 _net48  100N 
R22 _net44 _net47  15.9K tc1=0.0 tc2=0.0 
XOP12 0 0 _net49 _net50 _net51 VOUT_FILTER_SW SpiceOpamp_LM324
V30 0 _net51 DC 5
